Package: com.albrhi.tiktok
Name: Albrhi for TikTok (rootless)
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: No ads, and TikTok's own checks answered the way an unmodified phone would.
 .
 ▍NO ADS
 A feed item TikTok's own server marked as an ad never becomes an object at all — refused
 at the model itself, the moment it is built, rather than a view hidden after the fact.
 .
 ▍HIDES THE JAILBREAK
 TikTok asks several places whether the device is modified: a direct jailbreak check, its
 signing information, whether the app looks like a genuine App Store build, whether an
 embedded provisioning profile exists. Each is answered the way it would be on an
 unmodified phone. Nothing here touches a purchase, a receipt or a subscription.
 .
 ▍SEE WHAT IT CAUGHT
 Hold two fingers anywhere in TikTok for a screen with a switch for each feature and a
 report of what has actually run. Arabic and English.
 .
 TESTED ON TikTok 46.4.0. Nothing is pinned to a version number: every class is looked up
 at runtime and skipped if it is not there.
 .
 Architecture for both features was read from BandarHL's and al3raQe's published BHTikTok
 source (github.com/BandarHL/BHTikTok, github.com/al3raQe/BHTikTok) — neither carries a
 LICENSE file, so this is read for where TikTok is hookable only, the same cautious way
 this project treats every unlicensed reference. No code is taken from it; every class
 named here was independently confirmed present in TikTok's own binary before being
 hooked. Downloading videos is next.
 .
 Developed by Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn. Free and open source under the GNU GPL v3.
